[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To start Seerr:

  # sysrc seerr_enable=YES
  # service seerr start

then finish the setup in a browser at http://<host>:5055/.

The settings, the SQLite database and the logs live in /var/db/seerr
(seerr_datadir in rc.conf).  To use PostgreSQL instead, set DB_TYPE and
the DB_* variables described at https://docs.seerr.dev/ through
seerr_env.
EOM
}
]
